the situation. But then she accidentally fell into a valley and was saved by Zhe-Ming, who brought her back to his cave. Zhe-Ming is fixated on the idea that Mi-Mi is his female wolf, his mate, and they belong together. For her, Zhe-Ming decides to leave Wolf Mountain, and the two start a journey together, one filled with tons of laughter.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.1}],"value":8.1,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":4838,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}